{"3968140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Momentum Is Conserved", "steam_appid": 3968140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum is Conserved is a fast-paced first person platformer centered around one mechanic... momentum being conserved. Your only goal? Get to the end as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store your momentum to cancel your movement and bank it for later use</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968140/extras/878fd20ce41c8c129061636ddec94b50.poster.avif?t=1759712840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968140/extras/878fd20ce41c8c129061636ddec94b50.webm?t=1759712840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968140/extras/878fd20ce41c8c129061636ddec94b50.mp4?t=1759712840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release your stored momentum to boost your current momentum for bigger jumps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968140/extras/79b12f739f1e6f42d187253cf7ee0d4c.poster.avif?t=1759712840\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968140/extras/79b12f739f1e6f42d187253cf7ee0d4c.webm?t=1759712840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://